**Analysis of Project Code Related to this Test Case:**

The test case checks the functionality of user registration. When a user submits the registration form, the following process occurs in the project code:

```pseudocode
function register(username, password):
    if username is in users:
        return False  // Username already exists
    add username and password to the user file
    save username-password pair in 'users.txt'
    return True // Registration successful
```

### 2. Summarize Test Failed or Error Cases

