  - `test_logout`: Throws NoSuchElementException for "Logout" link.
  - `test_navigate_back_to_dashboard`: Throws NoSuchElementException for "Search Notes" link.
  - `test_search_for_note`: Throws NoSuchElementException for "Search Notes" link.
